# Line endings (task 0022). The repository stores LF everywhere and the tree is NOT renormalised: this file only pins
# the paths that broke when a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) was copied into a Linux container or runner.
# Shell scripts with CRLF fail with "bad interpreter", and the Lua integration tests compare file contents
# (test_vfs_dir/lines.txt must read "1\n", not "1\r\n").
# A Windows developer's existing CRLF working files stay as they are until git next rewrites them; "git status" stays
# clean because git normalises these paths on comparison.
*.sh text eol=lf
CI/*.txt text eol=lf
CI/github.env text eol=lf
tools/**/*.awk text eol=lf
scripts/data/integration_tests/** text eol=lf
